Instruction : Ticc (trap-number computation, register-register form)
Details :
Confirms the software trap number r[rs1]+r[rs2] wraps modulo 128
(SparcCore::execute_Ticc: ticc_trap_type = readBits(trap_number, 6, 0)),
not just modulo 256 or left unmasked, using operands whose sum (400)
overflows even the full byte range. The existing traps/ tests only use
small fixed trap numbers that never exercise this masking.
